{"key":"front/1930s","entities":[{"id":"front.songhu.1937","type":"front","labels":{"zh-Hans":"淞沪会战 · 登陆与市区推进"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1937-08-13","end":"1937-11-12","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[121.51,31.46],[121.35,31.41],[121.42,31.31]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[121.49,31.41],[121.4,31.36],[121.42,31.31]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[121.34,30.72],[121.23,31.03],[121.45,31.22]]}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.淞沪会战"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"8 月 13 日上海开战，中国军队围攻虹口日军据点；8 月 23 日日军第 11 师团在川沙口、吴淞口登陆，罗店、月浦、大场一线反复争夺；11 月 5 日第 10 军在金山卫登陆，经松江抄向上海侧后，11 月 12 日中国军队西撤。"},"tags":["战线","抗日战争"]},{"id":"front.taiyuan.1937","type":"front","labels":{"zh-Hans":"太原会战 · 忻口与娘子关"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1937-09-13","end":"1937-11-09","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[113.3,40.08],[112.9,39.18],[112.96,39.07],[112.71,38.73],[112.72,38.5],[112.55,37.87]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[114.51,38.04],[113.86,37.97],[113.58,37.86],[112.55,37.87]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[113.96,39.28],[112.96,39.07]]}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.book.正面战场作战记","chapter":"第三章第五节 太原会战"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"9 月日军第 5 师团由晋北南下，中国第二战区在忻口集结重兵设防；10 月忻口相持二十余日，郝梦龄、刘家麒阵亡，八路军在平型关、雁门关一带侧击。娘子关方向被第 20 师团突破，11 月 8 日夜日军突入太原城，9 日太原失守。"},"tags":["战线","抗日战争"]},{"id":"front.nanjing.1937","type":"front","labels":{"zh-Hans":"南京保卫战 · 外围与城垣"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1937-12-01","end":"1937-12-13","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[119.17,31.95],[118.9,32.06],[118.83,32.05],[118.78,32.06]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[118.38,31.33],[118.5,31.56],[118.78,31.99]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[119.42,30.89],[119.03,31.65],[118.78,32.06]]}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.book.正面战场作战记","chapter":"第四章第二节 南京保卫战"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"11 月中旬日军分三路由句容、溧水、芜湖向南京推进，中国守军在外围汤山、淳化、牛首山、雨花台节节抵抗；12 月 12 日中华门、雨花台失守，唐生智下令撤退，13 日日军入城。"},"tags":["战线","抗日战争"]},{"id":"front.xuzhou.1938","type":"front","labels":{"zh-Hans":"徐州会战 · 南北对进"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1938-01-01","end":"1938-05-19","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[117.16,35.08],[117.3,34.9],[117.73,34.56],[117.96,34.31],[117.18,34.26]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[118.35,35.1],[118.05,34.95],[117.73,34.56]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[117.18,34.26],[116.35,34.43],[115.65,34.41]]}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.book.正面战场作战记","chapter":"第四章第三节 徐州会战"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1938 年 1 月起日军南北对进：第 10 师团由滕县南下，第 5 师团由临沂西进，中国第五战区在台儿庄一带与其激战；5 月中旬日军完成合围，中国军队由徐州向西突围。"},"tags":["战线","抗日战争"]},{"id":"front.wuhan.1938","type":"front","labels":{"zh-Hans":"武汉会战 · 长江两岸"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1938-06-12","end":"1938-10-27","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[117.05,30.53],[116.68,29.99],[115.99,29.71],[115.68,29.67],[115.21,29.84],[114.3,30.59]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[115.99,29.71],[115.75,29.32],[115.89,28.68]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[117.28,31.86],[116.51,31.75],[114.09,32.15],[114.06,31.85],[114.3,30.59]]}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.武汉会战"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"6 月日军由安庆溯江西上，马当、九江相继失守；江北第 6 师团等部经六安、信阳南下，江南第 11 军沿瑞昌、德安推进，万家岭一带发生激战。10 月 25 日中国军队撤守武汉，26 日日军入城。"},"tags":["战线","抗日战争"]},{"id":"front.nanchang.1939","type":"front","labels":{"zh-Hans":"南昌会战 · 修水与反攻"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1939-03-17","end":"1939-05-09","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[115.99,29.71],[115.8,29.03],[115.89,28.68]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[115.89,28.68],[115.38,28.42],[114.92,28.24]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[115.38,28.42],[115.89,28.68]]}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.book.正面战场作战记","chapter":"第六章第二节 南昌会战"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1939 年 3 月日军由九江、永修方向进攻，强渡修水，27 日占领南昌；中国第九战区 4 月由高安、上高方向反攻，一度逼近城郊，未能克复，5 月再战。"},"tags":["战线","抗日战争"]},{"id":"front.suizao.1939","type":"front","labels":{"zh-Hans":"随枣会战 · 两路进攻"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1939-05-01","end":"1939-05-31","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[114.09,32.15],[113.42,32.37],[112.77,32.13],[113.38,31.69]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[112.59,31.17],[112.77,32.13]]}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.book.正面战场作战记","chapter":"第六章第四节 随枣会战"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"5 月日军第 3、第 13 师团分别由信阳、应山与钟祥两个方向进攻，中国第五战区部队在桐柏、大洪山一带抵抗后转移，日军一度占领随县、枣阳，随后退回原防。"},"tags":["战线","抗日战争"]},{"id":"front.changsha-1.1939","type":"front","labels":{"zh-Hans":"第一次长沙会战 · 两路南下"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1939-09-14","end":"1939-10-10","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[113.13,29.36],[113.1,29.1],[113.08,28.81],[112.94,28.23]]}},{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[113.82,29.25],[113.58,28.7],[112.94,28.23]]}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.第一次长沙会战"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"9 月日军由岳阳与通城两路南下，突破新墙河，进至汨罗江、捞刀河一线；中国第九战区逐次抵抗并侧击，10 月上旬日军退回新墙河北岸。"},"tags":["战线","抗日战争"]}]}